    "_sampling_split_note": "D005/M2. temperature is interleaved so both pools span the full range (Call A, approved): a contiguous low/high split would satisfy disjointness while confounding split membership with decoding temperature. Values are deduplicated by rounded value first -- the original list had 11 entries but 10 distinct temperatures. do_sample is listed in sampling_universe_shared: a documented I2 carve-out per DECISIONS.md A5, because a 2-value parameter cannot be split without putting all-greedy in one pool and all-stochastic in the other."
